            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Haynoi 0.2.8</h2>

<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>A third automatic upload route for networks where both standard paths</li>
</ul>
<p>  stall — dictation now tries a completely independent network edge</p>
<p>  before giving up.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sonpiaz/haynoi/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
